class Player(pygame.sprite.Sprite):
    def __init__(self, x, y):
        super().__init__()
        self.position = pygame.Vector2(x, y)

    def update(self, dt):
        self.position += pygame.Vector2(0, -1) * 200 * dt
Sprite provides group membership; you add position, update and draw.

